## AdAccountsApi

### Get ad account analytics
## Get ad account analytics
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/analytics?startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}&columns={{columns}}&granularity={{granularity}}&clickWindowDays={{clickWindowDays}}&engagementWindowDays={{engagementWindowDays}}&viewWindowDays={{viewWindowDays}}&conversionReportTime={{conversionReportTime}}&reportingTimezone={{reportingTimezone}}
Accept: application/json

### Get targeting analytics for an ad account
## Get targeting analytics for an ad account
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/targeting_analytics?startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}&targetingTypes={{targetingTypes}}&columns={{columns}}&granularity={{granularity}}&clickWindowDays={{clickWindowDays}}&engagementWindowDays={{engagementWindowDays}}&viewWindowDays={{viewWindowDays}}&conversionReportTime={{conversionReportTime}}&attributionTypes={{attributionTypes}}&reportingTimezone={{reportingTimezone}}
Accept: application/json

### Create ad account
## Create ad account
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "country": "<string>",
 "currency": "<string>",
 "name": "<string>",
 "owner_user_id": "<string>",
 "time_zone": "<string>"
}


### Get ad account
## Get ad account
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}
Accept: application/json

### List ad accounts
## List ad accounts
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts?includeSharedAccounts={{includeSharedAccounts}}&bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json

### Create a request for a brand, category, SKU report
## Create a request for a brand, category, SKU report
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/reports/brand_category_sku
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "ad_group_ids": "<string>",
 "campaign_ids": "<string>",
 "campaign_objective_types": "<string>",
 "click_window_days": "<string>",
 "columns": "<string>",
 "conversion_product_attribution_type": "<string>",
 "conversion_product_breakdown": "<string>",
 "conversion_report_time": "<string>",
 "end_date": "<string>",
 "granularity": "<string>",
 "level": "<string>",
 "product_sku_ids": "<string>",
 "report_name": "<string>",
 "start_date": "<string>",
 "view_window_days": "<string>"
}


### Create a request for a Marketing Mix Modeling (MMM) report
## Create a request for a Marketing Mix Modeling (MMM) report
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/mmm_reports
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "advertiser_ids": "<string>",
 "columns": "<string>",
 "countries": "<string>",
 "custom_column_ids": "<string>",
 "end_date": "<string>",
 "granularity": "<string>",
 "level": "<string>",
 "report_name": "<string>",
 "start_date": "<string>",
 "targeting_types": "<string>"
}


### Create async request for an account analytics report
## Create async request for an account analytics report
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/reports
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "ad_group_ids": "<string>",
 "ad_group_statuses": "<string>",
 "ad_ids": "<string>",
 "ad_statuses": "<string>",
 "attribution_types": "<string>",
 "campaign_brand_label": "<string>",
 "campaign_custom_label": "<string>",
 "campaign_ids": "<string>",
 "campaign_objective_types": "<string>",
 "campaign_statuses": "<string>",
 "click_window_days": "<string>",
 "columns": "<string>",
 "combine_targeting_types": "<string>",
 "conversion_report_time": "<string>",
 "custom_conversion_event_metrics": "<string>",
 "end_date": "<string>",
 "end_hour": "<number>",
 "engagement_window_days": "<string>",
 "granularity": "<string>",
 "level": "<string>",
 "metrics_filters": "<string>",
 "primary_sort": "<string>",
 "product_group_ids": "<string>",
 "product_group_statuses": "<string>",
 "product_item_ids": "<string>",
 "report_format": "<string>",
 "reporting_timezone": "<string>",
 "start_date": "<string>",
 "start_hour": "<number>",
 "targeting_types": "<string>",
 "view_window_days": "<string>"
}


### Create async request for an analytics report using a template
## Create async request for an analytics report using a template
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/templates/{{template_id}}/reports?startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}&granularity={{granularity}}
Accept: application/json

### Get advertiser brand, category, SKU report
## Get advertiser brand, category, SKU report
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/reports/brand_category_sku?token={{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Get advertiser Marketing Mix Modeling (MMM) report.
## Get advertiser Marketing Mix Modeling (MMM) report.
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/mmm_reports?token={{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Get the account analytics report created by the async call
## Get the account analytics report created by the async call
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/reports?token={{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Delete ads data for ad account in API Sandbox
## Delete ads data for ad account in API Sandbox
DELETE https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/sandbox
Accept: application/json

### List templates
## List templates
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/templates?bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}&order={{order}}
Accept: application/json
